  "issue_comments": [
    {
      "body": "Thanks for looking at this! There's already an open PR for #64497: #64499, opened about 2 hours earlier.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:06Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/64507#issuecomment-6500348173",
      "id": 6500348173,
      "updated_at": "2026-10-29T15:05:06Z",
      "user": {
        "login": "amd-lalithnc"
      }
    },
    {
      "body": "#64499 was opened about two hours earlier and addresses the same root cause. It takes a slightly broader approach by adding `get_worker_memory_nodes()` and also fixing `CpuPlatform.get_current_memory_usage()`, which my PR did not cover.\n\nOne difference worth noting for reviewers: my version patches the fallback inside `get_visible_memory_node()` itself, so every existing caller gets the fix. #64499 adds a wrapper and updates call sites individually. Either works; #64499 is the more complete of the two.\n\nClosing as duplicate.",
      "created_at": "2026-10-29T15:32:33Z",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/vllm-project/vllm/pull/64507#issuecomment-6501032008",
